<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apt. Investment.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apt. Investment.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros said in a research note it initiated coverage of Apartment Investment and Management Co, an owner and operator of aprtment properties across the southern United States.</p>
<p>-- 1997 and 1998 funds from operations estimates are $2.62 (per share) and $2.78 respectively.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect the company's FFO per to grow by 12 percent in 1997 nad by nine percent over the next two years,&quot; the note said.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is $26 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 to 24-5/8 in late morning NYSE trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1734</p>
</text>
